  "description": "The Shift S3 is an excellent full suspension performer. Its frame is made of 6061-T6 alloy featuring a tapered head tube and 120mm of travel. It features our single pivot design, which offers a simple & efficient suspension system with fewer pivots and bearings resulting in easy and low cost maintenance. Leading the way is a Suntour Raidon XC fork with 120mm of travel and its semi-complete Deore 2X drive train is matched to a Suntour XCM crankset. Efficient stopping is provided by a set of Tektro Auriga disc brakes complete with 180/160mm rotors.\n6061-T6 alloy single pivot frame, 120mm rear travel, tapered head tube, 73mm BB shell, 9mm Q/R rear dropouts\nSuntour Raidon-R rear shock\nSuntour Raidon-XC-LO-R fork, 120mm travel, air spring w/ lockout\nSuntour XCM 38/24T crankset w/ 24mm axle\nShimano Deore derailleur + shifters\nShimano Deore 10-spd 11-36T cassette\nTektro Auriga 180/160mm disc brakeset\nPivit alloy cockpit with 0 Deg. Trail stem",
